      "source": "Encapsulates the aggregation framework <code>$replaceRoot</code>-operation. <br/>\nThe operation replaces all existing fields including the <code>id</code> field with @{code $replaceWith}. This way it is\npossible to promote an embedded document to the top-level or specify a new document.",
      "translation": "封装了聚合框架中的 `$replaceRoot` 操作。<br/>\n该操作会用 @{code $replaceWith} 替换所有现有字段，包括 `id` 字段。通过这种方式，可以将嵌入文档提升为顶层文档，或者指定一个新文档。",
      "count": 1
    },
